00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:17,360
We just said, look, let's just start out

269
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:19,560
assuming we don't know anything about what's gonna happen,

270
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:22,200
but just tell me a probability, just give me something.

271
00:10:22,200 --> 00:10:23,520
I don't care what your probability is,

272
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:25,160
but whatever your probability is, I'm gonna tell you,

