00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:31,440
All right, and since no matter what answer you give me,

275
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:35,480
I can give you a reason not to play T3, you won't play it.

276
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:38,440
And once we erase that, then we can solve the game.

277
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:40,000
And then it turns out that your probability

278
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:43,240
