284
00:11:03,280 --> 00:11:07,400
So it's where it is sometimes strictly worse

285
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:09,080
and never strictly better.

286
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:12,520
So sometimes the payoff is greater

287
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:14,200
and it's never actually relevant.

288
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:18,640
All right, so this gives rise to another concept,

289
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:21,320
which is using weak dominance to solve a game.

290
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:25,040
So that's also on the table.

291
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:27,240
But unfortunately, weak dominance,

